  "steps": [
    "Season the tofu with salt, black pepper and corn flour.",
    "Pan-fry it in the olive oil until crispy.",
    "Add the soy sauce, gochujang, honey and lemon juice to the pan and toss until the tofu is well coated.",
    "Sprinkle over the sesame seeds.",
    "In a bowl, mix the Greek yogurt, chilli sauce, water and salt into a smooth yogurt dressing.",
    "Dip each rice paper in water for a few seconds until soft.",
    "Layer the lettuce, cabbage, carrot, cucumber, crispy tofu and some yogurt dressing on the rice papers.",
    "Roll tightly and serve with the rest of the dressing on the side."
  ],
